Phase 3 AI Integration (Days 12-14)

Do NOT just connect ChatGPT directly.

The important part is:

User asks:

Why did I spend more this month?

Backend:

Receive question
Get user's transactions
Calculate:
January food:
50k


February food:
90k

Increase:
80%
Send summary to OpenAI

AI explains it.

The PRD specifically says the AI must use actual user data and must not invent numbers.

What I would NOT build now

Leave these for later:

❌ Forgot password
❌ Email verification
❌ Streaming AI responses
❌ Bank connection
❌ Notifications
❌ Export PDF
❌ Multi-user accounts

They are in the PRD but not needed for the first portfolio version.

My recommendation

Start backend tomorrow.

